	(text "Port board, module side (spec section 1 wire plan, module column): SCK on RX+, its return on RX-, MOSI on TX+, MISO on TX-,\nCS on D+ (1k + 100 pF and 100k pull-up at the module: CS stays high while the hub does not drive it), INT on D- (10k pull-up here, none at the hub),\nMISO through 33 R at its source, LED data on SBU, +5V on VBUS, CC1/CC2 5.1k Rd each, shell direct to GND.\n3.3 V from VBUS via AP2112K-3.3 to bay pin 5. TPD4E1U06 on the six signals and CC, TVS0500 on VBUS.\nJ2 pin numbers equal the key board bay header J1; place the socket on the layer that mates pin 1 to pin 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 193.04 0)
		(effects
